---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="PRIVACY POLICY // DJ TOBINN">
  <main class="w-full min-h-screen bg-[#050505] text-white py-24 sm:py-32 px-6 sm:px-12 flex flex-col gap-16 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    
    <div class="border-b border-white/20 pb-8 flex flex-col items-start gap-8">
      <a href="/" class="font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/50 border border-white/20 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-white hover:text-black hover:border-white transition-all">
        < RETURN TO MAIN
      </a>
      <h1 class="display-text text-5xl sm:text-7xl uppercase tracking-tighter leading-[0.8] m-0">PRIVACY POLICY</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="font-sans font-bold text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed tracking-wider uppercase text-white/60 flex flex-col gap-12">
      
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tighter">1. DATA COLLECTION</h2>
        <p>
          WE COLLECT ONLY THE BARE MINIMUM DATA NECESSARY TO PROCESS BOOKING REQUESTS. THIS MAY INCLUDE YOUR NAME, EMAIL ADDRESS, AND EVENT DETAILS SUBMITTED VIA DIRECT COMMUNICATION. WE DO NOT USE INVASIVE TRACKING PIXELS OR THIRD-PARTY ANALYTICS COOKIES.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tighter">2. DATA USAGE</h2>
        <p>
          ANY INFORMATION YOU PROVIDE IS USED STRICTLY FOR DIRECT COMMUNICATION REGARDING GIGS, EVENTS, AND BOOKINGS. WE DO NOT SELL, RENT, OR SHARE YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION WITH EXTERNAL CORPORATIONS OR THIRD-PARTY ADVERTISERS.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tighter">3. SECURITY PROTOCOLS</h2>
        <p>
          COMMUNICATIONS SENT VIA EMAIL ARE STORED SECURELY USING STANDARD ENCRYPTION. HOWEVER, BE ADVISED THAT TRANSMISSION OVER THE PUBLIC INTERNET IS NEVER 100% SECURE. DO NOT TRANSMIT SENSITIVE FINANCIAL DATA VIA UNENCRYPTED CHANNELS.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tighter">4. THIRD-PARTY PLATFORMS</h2>
        <p>
          OUR SITE CONTAINS LINKS TO EXTERNAL PLATFORMS SUCH AS INSTAGRAM AND SOUNDCLOUD. ONCE YOU LEAVE THIS DOMAIN, YOU ARE SUBJECT TO THE PRIVACY POLICIES AND TERMS OF THOSE RESPECTIVE PLATFORMS.
        </p>
      </section>
      
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-white/20 pt-12">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tighter">CONTACT_SYS</h2>
        <p>FOR ANY PRIVACY CONCERNS OR DATA REMOVAL REQUESTS, CONTACT: <a href="mailto:booking@tobinn.com" class="text-white hover:underline">BOOKING@TOBINN.COM</a></p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
